{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UKMsvLE12vPijYtqwGHjnK","type":"tool_result","content":"548:class View {\n10367:my-3D2dge module ARCADE v0.85.2: the coin-op's frame: scores, high-score tables and initials, lives, credits, turns, cards, the attract mode\n10372:- const cab = new E.Arcade(game, { id: 'maze', lives: 3, extra: [10000] (or every: 20000), credits: null (free play;\n10379:  cab.enter(score, mode, done): initials on a letter wheel (up and down turn it, left and right move, confirm takes a\n10389:const E = My3D2dge, game = new E.Game({ headless: true }), cab = new E.Arcade(game, { id: 'doc', lives: 2, extra: [500] });\n10403: * ARCADE  scores, tables, initials, lives, credits, turns, cards and the attract mode\n10408:class Arcade {\n10409:  /** new E.Arcade(game, { id, lives: 3, extra: [] (the scores that give a life) or every (a life each that many points),\n10416:     *  next extra life) }]; p: the player up; credits: coins in (null: free play); entry: the initials being entered\n10469:  /** open the initials entry for score; done(name) once it is taken and saved */\n10578:E.Arcade = Arcade;\n548:class View {\n549-  /** new E.View(id, label, yaw, pitch, scale, zBoost): an orthographic camera (degrees; scale = screen pixels per\n550-   *  world unit; zBoost stretches heights). id: its name ('iso', or yours); label: its name for people ('Isometric') */\n551-  constructor(id, label, yaw, pitch, scale = 1, zBoost = 1) { this.id = id; this.label = label; this.set(yaw, pitch, scale, zBoost); }\n552-  /** change the angles and scale in place (game.setView and rotateView use their own copies); returns the view */\n553-  set(yaw, pitch, scale = 1, zBoost = 1) {\n554-    /** yawDeg: the turn about the up axis, degrees (0: north is up the screen; iso is 45); pitchDeg: the tilt, 0\n555-     *  side view to 90 straight down; scale: screen pixels per world unit; zBoost: how much heights are stretched on\n556-     *  screen (1 = true) */\n557-    this.yawDeg = yaw; this.pitchDeg = pitch; this.scale = scale; this.zBoost = zBoost;\n558-    const w = yaw * DEG, p = pitch * DEG, cw = Math.cos(w), sw = Math.sin(w), cp = Math.cos(p), sp = Math.sin(p);\n559-    /** yaw, pitch: the same angles in radians */\n560-    this.yaw = w; this.pitch = p;\n561-    /** ax, ay: screen x = ax * x + ay * y (the projection's first row) */\n562-    this.ax = scale * cw; this.ay = -scale * sw;\n563-    /** bx, by, bz: screen y = bx * x + by * y + bz * z (the second row; bz < 0 lifts things up the screen) */\n564-    this.bx = scale * sp * sw; this.by = scale * sp * cw; this.bz = -scale * cp * zBoost;\n565-    /** dx, dy, dz: the direction toward the camera, for true depth (view.depth); bigger is nearer */\n566-    this.dx = sw * cp; this.dy = cw * cp; this.dz = sp;   // true camera depth (bigger = nearer)\n567-    /** fx, fy: the ground direction that points at the camera (the front of a wall faces it) */\n568-    this.fx = sw; this.fy = cw;                           // ground direction that points at the camera\n569-    /** isTop: looking straight down (pitch 89 or more); isSide: a side view (pitch 1 or less: x right, z up, y is\n570-     *  depth) */\n571-    this.isTop = pitch >= 89; this.isSide = pitch <= 1;\n572-    const det = this.ax * this.by - this.ay * this.bx;\n573-    /** inv: the inverse of the ground projection (screen -> ground at z 0), null in side views */","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df25608b-8d30-41bd-8640-efa7a82527f1","uuid":"db560a3d-e476-4a55-8dad-fb464957d6a9","timestamp":"2026-11-04T13:33:07.698Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"548:class View {\n10367:my-3D2dge module ARCADE v0.85.2: the coin-op's frame: scores, high-score tables and initials, lives, credits, turns, cards, the attract mode\n10372:- const cab = new E.Arcade(game, { id: 'maze', lives: 3, extra: [10000] (or every: 20000), credits: null (free play;\n10379:  cab.enter(score, mode, done): initials on