{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi2GK7DGrs6ByuobZFgD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TU1ebM2Eatp1vEMwtXS4Qf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -i 's/const w = Math.min(r.W - 20, 176), x = 6, lines = E.font.wrap(COMM.line.text, w - 16), h = 14 + lines.length \\* 9, y = r.H - h - 30;/const w = Math.min(r.W - 20, 176), x = 6, lines = E.font.wrap(COMM.line.text, w - 16), h = 14 + lines.length * 9, y = 62;/' src/41-ui.js; grep -c \"y = 62;\" src/41-ui.js\ncat > DESIGN-NOTES.md <<'EOF'\n# Cricket Kerfuffle: design notes\n\nEverything is data plus a pure simulation; presentation reads the simulation and listens on the event bus.\n\n- `src/00-core.js` constants (pitch at x = 448, striker's stumps y = 330, bowler's y = 650), the seeded RNG streams, the TUNING registry (`TUNING_DEF`, read with `T('name')`), the event bus (`on`, `emit`).\n- `src/10-data.js` content: `TEAMS`, `GROUNDS`, `DIFFS`, `DELIVERIES`, `FIELD_PRESETS`, `CHAPTERS` (the story), `LINES` (commentary).\n- `src/20-ball.js` ball physics, the predictor (`predictUntil`), the delivery solver and the shot resolver.\n- `src/21-match.js` `createMatch(cfg)`: laws, scoring, running, fielding, AI intents, hype, chaos. `M.step(dt, { bat, bowl })` takes the same intents a person gives (null means the AI plays that role).\n- `src/30-art.js`..`41-ui.js` art, audio (chip synth, formant voices), HUD and menus. `50`..`75` scenes, dev mode and the AI Hub round.\n\nHow to add:\n- A team: add to `TEAMS` (cloth, trim, hat, skin colours). An opponent in the setup list: add its id to `OPPS` in `60-scenes.js`.\n- A ground: add to `GROUNDS` (sky, grass colours, night, bounce, music) and to `GROUND_IDS`.\n- A story chapter: append to `CHAPTERS` (intro/win/lose lines are `[speaker, text]`; speakers live in `SPEAKERS`).\n- A delivery: add to `DELIVERIES` (pace `sp`, `swing`, `turn`, `bounce`) and bind it in `bowlIntent`.\n- A stadium target: add to `TARGETS` in `21-match.js` (angle round the boundary, radius, bonus runs) and draw it in `drawSet`.\n- A commentary line: add to `LINES[kind]`. A balance variable: add to `TUNING_DEF`; it appears in dev mode by itself.\n\nTest: `node tools/build.mjs && node test/run.mjs` prints only failures and a count.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; node test/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -5"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2745,"cache_read_input_tokens":411481,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2745},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df25608b-8d30-41bd-8640-efa7a82527f1","uuid":"3ef4b8c7-2260-4381-9324-38b76a72297d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:11:03.538Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi2GHmb4qVi4c34N2mec","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01TU1ebM2Eatp1vEMwtXS4Qf":{"command":"sed -i 's/const w = Math.min(r.W - 20, 176), x = 6, lines = E.font.wrap(COMM.line.text, w - 16), h = 14 + lines.length \\* 9, y = r.H - h - 30;/const w = Math.min(r.W - 20, 176), x = 6, lines = E.font.wrap(COMM.line.text, w - 16), h = 14 + lines.length * 9, y = 62;/' src/41-ui.js; grep -c \"y = 62;\" src/41-ui.js\ncat > DESIGN-NOTES.md <<'EOF'\n# Cricket Kerfuffle: design notes\n\nEverything is data plus a pure simulation; presentation reads the simulation and listens on the event bus.\n\n- `src/00-core.js` constants (pitch at x = 448, striker's stumps y = 330, bowler's y = 650), the seeded RNG streams, the TUNING registry (`TUNING_DEF`, read with `T('name')`), the event bus (`on`, `emit`).\n- `src/10-data.js` content: `TEAMS`, `GROUNDS`, `DIFFS`, `DELIVERIES`, `FIELD_PRESETS`, `CHAPTERS` (the story), `LINES` (commentary).\n- `src/20-ball.js` ball physics, the predictor (`predictUntil`), the delivery solver and the shot resolver.\n- `src/21-match.js` `createMatch(cfg)`: laws, scoring, running, fielding, AI intents, hype, chaos. `M.step(dt, { bat, bowl })` takes the same intents a person gives (null means the AI plays that role).\n- `src/30-art.js`..`41-ui.js` art, audio (chip synth, formant voices), HUD and menus. `50`..`75` scenes, dev mode and the AI Hub round.\n\nHow to add:\n- A team: add to `TEAMS` (cloth, trim, hat, skin colours). An opponent in the setup list: add its id to `OPPS` in `60-scenes.js`.\n- A ground: add to `GROUNDS` (sky, grass colours, night, bounce, music) and to `GROUND_IDS`.\n- A story chapter: append to `CHAPTERS` (intro/win/lose lines are `[speaker, text]`; speakers live in `SPEAKERS`).\n- A delivery: add to `DELIVERIES` (pace `sp`, `swing`, `turn`, `bounce`) and bind it in `bowlIntent`.\n- A stadium target: add to `TARGETS` in `21-match.js` (angle round the boundary, radius, bonus runs) and draw it in `drawSet`.\n- A commentary line: add to `LINES[kind]`. A balance variable: add to `TUNING_DEF`; it appears in dev mode by itself.\n\nTest: `node tools/build.mjs && node test/run.mjs` prints only failures and a count.\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs | tail -1; node test/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -5"}}}
