{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi2QG8Lc9NPdf1m68cY6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Every feature TASK.md lists is implemented, and nothing in it asks for Nets or a replay review. Those two came from PLAN.md, and TASK.md wins where they disagree, so I described them as plan items I left out, not missing TASK.md features. Rain, cows and golden balls are all verified, and the four required sections are in the reply above.\n\nI checked the chaos events with 30 more simulated matches. Golden balls triggered 35 times, cows 30 (stopping the ball 17 times), and rain 26 times, ending 14 times. Over a full three-over match, the stadium-target bonus runs triggered for the tea urn and the church bell.\n\nI did not play a pub-window or clock-tower bonus in that run.\n\nTASK.md's requirements, as I checked them against the build:\n\n- **Mechanics:** the game is a complete arcade cricket game, not a stub. You can bat, bowl and field, and the full chaos and arcade layer is in.\n- **Attract mode:** it starts after 10 idle seconds and is covered by tests.\n- **Dev mode:** it opens from the pause menu, with live sliders, a reset-all and test tools. Tests cover it.\n- **Multiplayer:** it follows the AI Hub README, and the harness passes in a real browser.\n- **Controls and prompts:** they are controller-first, and PlayStation/Xbox glyphs switch in Settings.\n- **Touch-only devices:** they show \"Controller or keyboard required\".\n- **Audio and voices:** all audio is code, with gibberish voices.\n- **Source and credits:** the in-game About screen has the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback pages.\n- **Files and code:** the single HTML file is in the root, `exit-interview.json` parses with every field filled, and there are no TODOs or placeholders in the code."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":714,"cache_read_input_tokens":420068,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":714},"output_tokens":614,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df25608b-8d30-41bd-8640-efa7a82527f1","uuid":"f1cf990a-65af-44ea-91f4-d146aa0d0351","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:12:41.996Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi2QFkGYryNijqnFh4oW"}
