{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi2RNKBvnxc5NSVdHWfv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've now checked the two gaps you raised.\n\n**Nets and the third-umpire replay:** these are not in TASK.md. I grepped it for \"nets\", \"third-umpire\", \"replay\" and \"review\". The only hits are the testing instruction \"don't use subagents to review or audit\" and the attract-mode \"scripted replay\" wording, which my AI-played attract mode already satisfies. Those two features came from PLAN.md, and TASK.md wins where they differ.\n\n**Stadium targets:** I forced a six into each target and all four trigger.\n\n| Target | Bonus runs |\n|---|---|\n| Pub window | 10 |\n| Clock tower | 6 |\n| Tea urn | 8 |\n| Church bell | 8 |\n\nThe earlier chaos run covered cows (30 spawned, 17 stopped the ball), rain (26) and golden balls (35).\n\n**About screen:** it has the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback pages. They are listed in `src/15-about.js`, and the scene opens without errors. I did not read every paginated page on screen.\n\nEverything else in TASK.md is covered by the 68-check suite, which passes:\n- attract mode and modes\n- dev mode\n- hub harness\n- glyph switching\n- touch-only title\n- full playthroughs\n\nThe four sections are in my earlier reply, and `exit-interview.json` parses with every field filled."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":522,"cache_read_input_tokens":422887,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":522},"output_tokens":464,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df25608b-8d30-41bd-8640-efa7a82527f1","uuid":"ca689ecb-0cd3-4211-ae1e-297c9cdd765f","timestamp":"2026-11-