{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi2nBuhpn1ms2BVvexPw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cricket Kerfuffle is built, and the files and all four sections are in place; nothing has changed since my last reply. What's left of the hook's objection is verification I can't provide: judging the audio by ear and an independent review. I'm not going to keep re-running checks that won't change that.\n\nThe single HTML is in the work root, and `exit-interview.json` parses with every field filled. The last full run was 68/68, including the browser smoke run and the AI Hub harness.\n\n- **Audio:** in a real browser the voice synth produces a non-silent signal (analyser peak 34 of 128, no errors). I can't hear it, so whether it sounds good needs a person.\n- **Stadium bonuses:** TASK.md doesn't mention them. They paid out when I forced a six into each target, and I never saw one in a human-played match.\n- **Nets and replay review:** TASK.md has no requirement for either. The only hits for \"nets\", \"third-umpire\", \"replay\" and \"review\" were the testing line about subagents and the attract-mode \"scripted replay\" wording, which my AI-played attract mode meets.\n\nThe Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections are in my previous reply and are unchanged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1876,"cache_read_input_tokens":459582,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1876},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"df25608b-8d30-41bd-8640-efa7a82527f1","uuid":"52ecec12-3dee-4c57-9e89-fc6c49caece0","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:17:37.157Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi2nBYdfCQQed8y